==================== Input ====================
# An indentation indicator counts from the enclosing collection's items (YAML's `n + m`):
# the content moves with them when they are re-indented, keeping its value.
moves-left:
    value: |2
          more-indented
    entry:
        - |2
              more-indented
        - key: |2
                more-indented
moves-right:
 value: >2
     more-indented
 entry:
 - |2
     more-indented

